  {
   "id": "b4",
   "function": "insight",
   "scene_type": "comparison",
   "duration_hint": 14,
   "spoken": "On top of that, there's everyday help: the manager creates strong passwords, fills them in when you log in, and can warn you when a site doesn't match the saved address. The NCSC explicitly encourages password managers.",
   "data": {
    "headline": "In your head or in a manager",
