   ],
   "overlay": {}
  },
  {
   "id": "b5",
   "function": "insight",
   "scene_type": "file_fork",
   "duration_hint": 12,
   "spoken": "The BSI also names the downsides: forget the master password, and in the worst case all the data is gone. And if an attack on the manager succeeds, all passwords can be stolen at once. So the master password has to be strong.",
